 "Đạt phần lớn (theo báo cáo): W8-01, W8-05, W8-14 xong 02/11. Cần xác nhận code W8-05 và PR integration/sprint-3 đã merge dev.": "Mostly met (per the report): W8-01, W8-05, W8-14 finished on 02/11. Still need to confirm W8-05 and PR integration/sprint-3 are merged to dev.",
 "BE: PaymentController, WebhookController, PlanController · FE: BuyPointsPage, CheckoutPage, PaypalReturnPage (đã merge PR #95)": "BE: PaymentController, WebhookController, PlanController · FE: BuyPointsPage, CheckoutPage, PaypalReturnPage (PR #95 merged)",
